__pycache__/
*.pyc

# NOTE: results.json is NOT ignored, on purpose.
#
# The scaffold shipped a .gitignore that hid it while its own README
# asked for it to be committed. A pass rate submitted without the run
# that produced it is not a measurement, and a marker reads results.json
# alongside the report - so it belongs in the repository.
#
# The same goes for output/*.json: those are the measurements every
# section of the report quotes. See output/README.md.
